<title>FINLAND: FINNLINES 8-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 302 MLN.</title>
<headline>FINNLINES 8-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 302 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31,</p>
<p>					(million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		    302 vs 202</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	   11.02 vs 7.98</p>
<p> Net sales				   1,308 vs 1,575</p>
<p> Operating profit			    331 vs 239</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast profit after financial</p>
<p>items was 299 million markka (mean 301 million) in a 289 to 324</p>
<p>million markka range.</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation  424 vs 317</p>
<p> Depreciation			  charge 93 vs 78 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					    18 vs 14</p>
<p> Net profit				    211 vs 153</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     38.8 vs 31.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish shipping company is Finnlines Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
